                                "sense_id": "90497595-0062-3421-8fe7-7e1974cb2fa8",
                                "text": "In determining how to accommodate the employee, both attorneys said it is important to take your \"cue\" from the employee, but also to examine what medical criteria says about transgendereds."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "1c06ba34-7509-4a8d-9839-c8e2749e16af",
                                "sense_id": "90497595-0062-3421-8fe7-7e1974cb2fa8",
                                "text": "In addition to ex-convicts and drug addicts, stigmas are also applied to lesbians, gays, transgendereds, and people who have been hospitalized for mental illness, even after they leave the hospital."
